SUMMARY:Carry the scope out from the porch
DESCRIPTION:Already at ambient\, camera already cold. Onto the tripod - a
 lt/az untouched\, so this Polar align CHECK - the plate may have shifted
  and the ground settles\, so expect a small adjustment. Not from scratch
 . DEW HEATERS ON NOW\, low setting. Target 2-5C above ambient\, no more 
 - err low on the triplet.
