DTEND:20260814T051000Z
SUMMARY:Scope on Dark Shark LDN 1235 + vdB 152
DESCRIPTION:Centre at Dec +71 47' with the long axis N-S and both cores l
 and in one frame. Grey-brown dust shapes plus a blue reflection knot. Ou
 ter dust clips on each - that's the accepted trade.
